01:01.360 --> 01:03.370
No, you hang yourself.

01:03.370 --> 01:05.210
<b>k-s, Saito</b>

01:05.200 --> 01:08.460
You'll be happier that way!

01:08.920 --> 01:10.960
I'm the creator here.

01:10.960 --> 01:13.350
These little shits got nothing.

01:24.480 --> 01:27.620
Hey, stay away! That's my masterpiece!

01:27.620 --> 01:28.720
It looks interesting.

01:30.860 --> 01:32.200
Interesting?

01:33.650 --> 01:34.840
Y-Yeah, it is.

01:35.160 --> 01:37.630
My game is the best ever.

01:39.300 --> 01:42.490
But you could still make it better.

01:53.260 --> 01:56.700
I want you to use these to build a world.

01:57.160 --> 01:58.960
Do it for me.

01:58.960 --> 02:02.010
Build... a world?

02:02.010 --> 02:03.520
I'm bored.

02:14.920 --> 02:17.640
Fine, I will.

02:18.170 --> 02:21.280
The game was just a way to kill time.

02:21.920 --> 02:26.570
But if you, a god, are trying to kill time,

02:26.570 --> 02:30.520
I'll present you with my top-quality work.

02:32.520 --> 02:35.010
Do you have a name?

02:38.490 --> 02:39.760
Origin.

02:40.170 --> 02:41.440
Origin.

02:41.940 --> 02:44.640
Fine, then. I'll build one for you.

02:45.280 --> 02:49.010
A world where I can take those 
fools who've been mouthing off,

02:49.320 --> 02:52.770
and do whatever I like with them.

04:33.550 --> 04:34.500
Gobo.

04:34.500 --> 04:35.880
What the—?

04:35.880 --> 04:37.620
What, what, what the hell are you?

04:37.620 --> 04:39.010
Gobo bobo?

04:39.010 --> 04:41.130
What's with your face?

04:41.130 --> 04:43.090
Gobo go... gobo?

04:44.260 --> 04:46.760
Gobo. Gobo!

04:46.760 --> 04:47.590
Sheesh.

04:47.590 --> 04:50.510
What's wrong with me? 
You're not that tough.

04:51.530 --> 04:54.640
I guess ya don't plan on living long.

04:56.400 --> 04:59.680
Gobo. Gobo bo!

05:07.030 --> 05:10.080
Yes, wonderful! I can feel you.

05:10.080 --> 05:14.160
Your will, your impulse. Your resolve!

05:14.160 --> 05:16.790
You seem to think you're 
in good hands, Slayer,

05:16.790 --> 05:19.050
but I'm about to make you go "pop"!

05:19.050 --> 05:21.080
What harsh words.

05:21.080 --> 05:25.670
Aren't magical girls supposed 
to behave differently?

05:26.020 --> 05:28.050
Something like this.

05:32.730 --> 05:35.800
Die, Anarchy!

05:37.270 --> 05:38.060
Gobo!

05:42.450 --> 05:44.700
Hey! No, no, no!

05:43.910 --> 05:44.700
What?

05:44.700 --> 05:46.320
What the hell's going on?!

05:46.320 --> 05:49.440
How would I know?! 
This is totally different from before!

06:06.110 --> 06:08.260
Hey, what's going on in there?

06:08.260 --> 06:10.840
Did Otaku Hero find Shobon yet?

06:10.840 --> 06:13.560
I don't know! I haven't heard from anyone!

06:14.920 --> 06:16.480
Damn it, Otaku Hero!

06:16.480 --> 06:18.230
What are you doing?

06:21.310 --> 06:22.370
<i>Otaku Hero!</i>

06:22.370 --> 06:23.230
Nick!

06:23.230 --> 06:24.380
We're screwed!

06:24.380 --> 06:25.990
Akiba is getting blown to bits!

06:26.320 --> 06:27.620
<i>Anarchy-chan and the others?</i>

06:27.620 --> 06:28.740
They're still fighting.

06:29.320 --> 06:31.610
But two more Slayer types showed up!

06:31.610 --> 06:32.920
Is it Orange and Green?

06:32.920 --> 06:34.140
<i>How did you know?!</i>

06:34.140 --> 06:35.410
Damn it!

06:35.410 --> 06:37.120
Heading to Akiba now!

06:37.120 --> 06:39.870
I can't let this follow the script!

06:39.870 --> 06:40.960
<i>Script?</i>

06:40.960 --> 06:44.860
He had us in the palm 
of his hand the whole time!

06:42.380 --> 06:45.550
(Otaku) What the hell's going on?!

(Otaku) Hey, what's going on in there?
Waaah!

06:42.380 --> 06:45.550
Sends the magical incarnation
Pink attacks

 Blue's magical incarnation attacks
 They fight

 Blue attacks

06:52.260 --> 06:54.200
Go. Bo. Gobo!

06:54.740 --> 06:56.260
Gobo bo!

06:57.900 --> 06:59.010
Gobo...

07:01.360 --> 07:04.520
Rage Against the Magic!

07:09.690 --> 07:10.530
Gobo-bo!

07:10.960 --> 07:12.040
Gobo!

07:12.040 --> 07:12.800
Gobo.

07:12.810 --> 07:14.920
Gobo gobo gobo-bobo!

07:15.550 --> 07:16.290
Gobo!

07:20.280 --> 07:21.240
Gobo?

07:25.040 --> 07:27.470
It's all over now!

07:30.360 --> 07:31.670
Gobo?

07:32.340 --> 07:34.090
Gobo bobo bobo?!

07:34.090 --> 07:35.100
The hell?

07:35.880 --> 07:37.090
Is it self-destructing?

07:41.850 --> 07:42.850
Huh?

07:45.110 --> 07:46.480
Gobo?

07:56.640 --> 07:58.400
Gobo.

08:00.910 --> 08:03.660
Yeah, yeah! Like that!

08:04.570 --> 08:06.040
Don't hold back!

08:06.040 --> 08:08.590
This is where things get interesting!

08:08.590 --> 08:10.540
No! Don't open the door!

08:10.780 --> 08:12.850
You absolutely can't open that door!

08:15.550 --> 08:16.280
Go—?

08:17.120 --> 08:18.920
What the hell is this?

08:18.920 --> 08:20.280
Gobo-bo?

08:22.000 --> 08:23.400
What is that?

08:35.090 --> 08:37.570
Disgusting! So disgusting!

08:39.370 --> 08:42.200
Don't know what you are, 
but I won't let you!

08:50.260 --> 08:51.250
Gobo!

09:10.020 --> 09:11.280
Gobo...

09:16.150 --> 09:16.770
Gobo!

09:20.480 --> 09:22.880
What was that? Say it again!

09:22.880 --> 09:25.120
<i>Otaku Hero is on his way to Akiba.</i>

09:25.120 --> 09:26.160
<i>Tell the troops to retreat!</i>

09:26.160 --> 09:27.040
No frickin' way!

09:27.040 --> 09:28.300
You think we can stop now?

09:28.300 --> 09:30.540
We haven't even found Shobon yet!

09:30.540 --> 09:32.090
He must be hiding somewhere!

09:32.090 --> 09:33.180
<i>Yeah, obviously!</i>

09:33.180 --> 09:36.040
This is our last chance 
to un-brainwash Japan!

09:36.040 --> 09:38.550
If we retreat now, it's all over!

09:38.550 --> 09:41.840
<i>But right now we're just 
playing into their hands!</i>

09:41.840 --> 09:43.640
Too many have died.

09:44.600 --> 09:46.810
Let us fight until we're satisfied!

09:49.820 --> 09:51.010
<i>Fine.</i>

10:12.430 --> 10:15.630
Lovely. Yes, more!

10:15.630 --> 10:17.460
Keep coming at me, Anarchy!

10:17.720 --> 10:19.550
Keep fighting for me!

10:19.550 --> 10:21.390
Fighting for you?

10:21.390 --> 10:22.600
How dare you think—!

10:22.600 --> 10:27.170
Yes, because I was born 
to fight this battle on this day!

10:28.230 --> 10:30.170
You know, I honestly

10:30.170 --> 10:33.440
think I was born to fight this battle.

10:33.950 --> 10:35.030
What did you say?

10:35.030 --> 10:36.440
Are you any different?

10:37.480 --> 10:38.440
But I'm—

10:38.440 --> 10:40.950
"So totally pissed off, I can't handle it"?

10:40.950 --> 10:42.200
Th-That's right.

10:42.200 --> 10:45.330
"I'm gonna burn her 
until there are no ashes left"?

10:45.330 --> 10:48.320
That's right! I'm totally taking you down!

10:48.320 --> 10:49.580
For what reason?

10:49.580 --> 10:52.580
So I can continue to like 
the things I want to like!

10:52.580 --> 10:54.340
But I'm going to be the last one standing.

10:54.340 --> 10:55.540
No, I am!

10:56.540 --> 10:59.080
We really are alike, aren't we—

10:59.080 --> 11:00.680
Would you shut your mouth for once?!

11:00.680 --> 11:01.990
We're nothing alike!

11:01.990 --> 11:05.750
You're just a puppet 
for that boob-tube creep!

11:05.750 --> 11:06.960
Don't compare me to you!

11:06.960 --> 11:09.680
Yes, that is right.

11:09.680 --> 11:11.320
That is how it should've been.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.200
What?

11:12.560 --> 11:14.560
Working for Shobon:

11:14.560 --> 11:16.760
that is my entire purpose.

11:16.760 --> 11:18.120
Or, it was.

11:19.490 --> 11:22.380
But this is different. Right now,

11:22.790 --> 11:23.870
I live for this moment!

11:23.870 --> 11:24.610
For this moment?

11:28.910 --> 11:31.630
It's only when I'm fighting you,

11:40.280 --> 11:44.440
stabbing you, hitting you, beating you down!

11:44.780 --> 11:47.770
Right this moment, when I kill you,

11:52.030 --> 11:54.730
is when I feel alive!

11:54.730 --> 11:56.860
Feel... alive?

11:56.860 --> 11:59.280
Yes, I understand it now.

11:59.890 --> 12:03.370
What you like, as much 
as you like, wasn't it?

12:03.790 --> 12:05.480
I like something now, too.

12:05.480 --> 12:10.840
I like the me that doesn't exist merely 
to love and obey Shobon-sama!

12:10.840 --> 12:15.670
I like myself, living here and now!

12:15.920 --> 12:18.170
How can you be so damn lively?

12:18.170 --> 12:20.210
How can you smile about this?

12:20.210 --> 12:22.340
You disgusting bitch!

12:24.380 --> 12:29.950
You assholes have destroyed so 
many things that people like.

12:30.260 --> 12:31.550
Do you have any clue?

12:31.760 --> 12:34.650
After that, you think I'm going to 
let you have what you want?

12:36.220 --> 12:38.870
Come on, come on. Come on, Anarchy!

12:38.870 --> 12:42.690
Let's kill each other off 
like two good magical girls!

12:46.400 --> 12:48.290
Magical girls?

12:48.290 --> 12:51.920
Do you seriously think you're that special?

12:52.530 --> 12:57.350
You're only here to paint 
this world one color.

12:57.680 --> 12:59.800
You're nothing but tools!

13:00.440 --> 13:03.970
You're only a checkpoint 
on the way to the next stage.

13:03.970 --> 13:06.960
A primary endpoint!

13:03.970 --> 13:06.970
Slayer attacks

 Anarchy and Slayer collide

 get swallowed in light

13:07.400 --> 13:13.170
You're here to eliminate the poison 
of otakuism and purify the world.

13:13.170 --> 13:15.600
You'll become the antidote!

13:31.090 --> 13:33.550
What... is this?

13:36.120 --> 13:37.080
Gobo?

13:40.080 --> 13:42.030
Gobo! Gobo gobo gobo!

13:42.030 --> 13:45.200
We can't let the antidote 
get contaminated now, can we?

13:45.200 --> 13:50.090
So now you will purify yourselves!

13:52.350 --> 13:52.840
Gobo!

13:57.310 --> 14:00.570
Why? I can't stop. I can't stop!

14:02.820 --> 14:06.320
Gobo gobo!

14:06.560 --> 14:09.960
You can't do this. Stop. You have to stop!

14:10.230 --> 14:13.080
These are important to me. 
These are the things I like!

14:13.080 --> 14:14.080
Gobo!

14:14.080 --> 14:16.500
Don't steal that from me!

14:16.500 --> 14:18.250
Don't make it all a lie!

14:18.880 --> 14:22.840
Gobo!

14:23.100 --> 14:26.350
Please stop. These are dear to me!

14:26.850 --> 14:28.350
For heaven's sake!

14:30.770 --> 14:32.260
I get it.

14:32.260 --> 14:33.760
Liking things...

14:33.760 --> 14:35.770
being happy...

14:35.770 --> 14:38.140
Those were my reasons for living.

14:38.140 --> 14:40.890
Gobo!

14:40.890 --> 14:44.160
To say what I like, as much as I like!

14:58.880 --> 15:00.760
You steal everything from otaku,

15:01.360 --> 15:04.380
and your only response to that is self-love?

15:04.590 --> 15:06.190
Don't make me laugh!

15:06.190 --> 15:08.930
Otaku will die without the things they like.

15:08.930 --> 15:13.080
You crush those things, 
and that makes you feel alive?

15:13.080 --> 15:14.270
Don't make me laugh!

15:14.590 --> 15:17.440
The look on your face! It's lovely, Anarchy!

15:17.440 --> 15:20.270
You are just like me. 
I can tell that right now,

15:20.270 --> 15:22.410
you feel alive!

15:23.030 --> 15:24.020
Shut up!

15:24.020 --> 15:26.030
I'm nothing like you!

15:26.030 --> 15:29.440
I have things that I would never give up!

15:29.440 --> 15:34.410
The past that he protected for us!
The future he's trying to find!

15:34.790 --> 15:36.320
Who cares about "now"?

15:36.320 --> 15:41.010
If that's so important to you, 
I'll end you. Right now!

15:41.010 --> 15:42.530
And then...

15:42.530 --> 15:45.050
And then? And then?!

15:45.050 --> 15:48.800
And then I'll continue 
into the future with him.

15:48.800 --> 15:50.510
And then I'll tell him

15:51.800 --> 15:53.090
as much as I want

15:53.380 --> 15:54.390
that I like him!

15:55.440 --> 15:56.970
That I love him!

15:57.600 --> 15:59.770
I'll tell him!

16:00.380 --> 16:02.930
Now <i>that</i> is a flag.

16:14.950 --> 16:16.440
Oh, crap! Oh, crap!

16:16.440 --> 16:18.150
Let's split, old guy!

16:23.830 --> 16:26.820
Nick! Nick! Damn it!

16:27.110 --> 16:27.920
<i>Please make it in time!</i>

16:28.360 --> 16:30.520
<i>Please make it in time! 
Please make it in time!</i>

16:30.520 --> 16:32.800
<i>I'll rewrite the script myself!</i>

16:32.800 --> 16:34.370
<i>So don't go!</i>

16:34.760 --> 16:39.260
Blue-chan! Pink-chan! Anarchy-chan!

16:45.340 --> 16:48.620
It seems the drugs are finally kicking in.

16:48.620 --> 16:52.520
That's amniotic fluid. 
It's where you were born.

16:52.890 --> 16:55.410
Doesn't it have a familiar odor?

17:00.960 --> 17:02.130
Gobo!

17:02.130 --> 17:03.450
Gobo!

17:04.960 --> 17:11.590
Gobo!

17:51.220 --> 17:54.920
Go back and join Anarchy, Slayer.

18:16.680 --> 18:18.200
I knew it.

18:18.360 --> 18:22.950
Anarchy...

 Slayer takes a powerful hit

 punch

 kick

18:18.690 --> 18:23.840
I was born to fight this battle...

18:22.950 --> 18:25.120
stick
swinging
Ana
(climax)

18:23.840 --> 18:25.210
to lose this battle.

18:25.210 --> 18:26.960
But I still—!

18:30.320 --> 18:32.200
What a stubborn girl.

18:35.710 --> 18:39.720
Your role in this is has now ended.

18:35.800 --> 18:38.590
when Slayer runs
out of energy

Anarchy's

18:38.590 --> 18:39.630
when Slayer runs out of energy

