Ow.

19:01.010 --> 19:03.440
My role is over?

19:04.740 --> 19:07.740
No, it's about to begin.

19:08.220 --> 19:13.830
Because right now I feel 
more alive than ever!

19:32.960 --> 19:35.640
It's all going according to script.

19:36.330 --> 19:40.150
I tried to create the ultimate game.

19:40.560 --> 19:43.700
One that copies nothing, 
that nobody can copy.

19:43.700 --> 19:46.160
I embody that originality.

19:46.160 --> 19:49.270
I am the true creator!

19:50.280 --> 19:54.160
But with the creator of this 
world standing before you,

19:54.160 --> 19:56.160
I say it is all fiction.

19:56.390 --> 20:00.090
You are all nothing but simple NPCs,

20:00.090 --> 20:02.750
living and dying 
in the roles you were given.

20:03.460 --> 20:06.350
But I alone am different!

20:06.350 --> 20:10.940
I was chosen to be 
the designer of a new world!

20:10.940 --> 20:15.820
And to be your playable character.

20:16.560 --> 20:18.570
How does my script look now?

20:18.850 --> 20:20.540
Are you enjoying it,

20:21.610 --> 20:22.750
Origin?

20:23.320 --> 20:26.320
Well, will it appear soon?

20:26.920 --> 20:30.160
The final flag.

20:47.880 --> 20:48.890
Anarchy-chan!

21:31.770 --> 21:33.240
Congratulations.

21:33.820 --> 21:37.190
You have now been born

21:38.340 --> 21:39.950
as magical girls.

21:47.880 --> 21:51.410
Magical Destroyers.

23:25.960 --> 23:26.960
Can you hear us?

23:26.960 --> 23:29.970
Are our voices reaching you?

23:30.600 --> 23:33.970
We are gone, and you left us behind.

23:33.970 --> 23:35.970
Where are you now,

23:35.970 --> 23:39.970
with all that sin, 
punishment, and atonement?
